      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Fair court time: the maths behind the waiting</h1>
      <p class="lede">If 24 players share three doubles courts, half the room must be off court at any instant. No rotation system can fix that. What it can do is decide whether the unavoidable waiting is shared sensibly.</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Guide</span>
        <span>Fairness</span>
